---
import { navigation } from '../data/navigation';
---
<footer class="mt-16 bg-ink py-12 text-slate-300"><div class="container grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><a href="/" class="text-lg font-bold text-white">百家樂攻略誌</a><p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm leading-6">提供以規則、機率與風險意識為基礎的百家樂教育內容。</p></div><nav aria-label="頁尾導覽"><ul class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">{navigation.map((item) => <li><a class="text-sm hover:text-white" href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}</ul></nav></div><p class="container mt-10 border-t border-slate-700 pt-5 text-xs">© {new Date().getFullYear()} 百家樂攻略誌。內容僅供教育與娛樂參考。</p></footer>
